    "Create an empty caller-owned fixture directory, set MO_CHART_LABEL_CASE_DIR to it and run cargo test -p mo-kernel-api --test pptx_chart_labels. This exports 28 owned corpus inputs.",
    "Build mo-cli and mo-wasm; use wasm-bindgen --target nodejs and a CommonJS package.json.",
    "Prepare a cases array with name, source, request, expectedStatus. Private templates are optional local inputs, not distributed fixtures.",
    "node tools/verification/chart-label-parity.mjs <cli> <wasm.js> <cases.json> <new-parity.json>",
    "python3 tools/verification/chart-label-oracle.py <cli> <cases.json> <new-oracle.json>",
    "cargo test -p mo-presentation-compile --test source_chart_labels includes the 4096-label isolation test."
  ],
